# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The usual spin formulation of MaxCut on a graph $G = (V, E)$ assigns\n"
"$s_v \\in \\{-1, +1\\}$ to each vertex. An edge is cut when $s_u s_v = -1$, so the cut size is:\n"
msgstr ""
"Formularea obișnuită cu spini a lui MaxCut pe un graf $G = (V, E)$ atribuie\n"
"$s_v \\in \\{-1, +1\\}$ fiecărui vârf. O muchie este tăiată atunci când $s_u s_v = -1$, deci dimensiunea tăieturii este:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\operatorname{Cut}(s) = \\sum_{(u,v) \\in E} \\frac{1 - s_u s_v}{2}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\operatorname{Cut}(s) = \\sum_{(u,v) \\in E} \\frac{1 - s_u s_v}{2}.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"JijModeling does not provide a native spin decision variable, and SQOA Solver accepts binary QUBO\n"
"variables. Therefore, declare $b_v \\in \\{0, 1\\}$ and define the spin-valued expression\n"
"$s_v = 1 - 2b_v$ inside the model. With this expression, the objective stays in the standard spin form, and the\n"
"compiled instance remains a binary QUBO.\n"
msgstr ""
"JijModeling nu oferă o variabilă de decizie de spin nativă, iar SQOA Solver acceptă variabile\n"
"QUBO binare. Prin urmare, declară $b_v \\in \\{0, 1\\}$ și definește expresia cu valori de spin\n"
"$s_v = 1 - 2b_v$ în interiorul modelului. Cu această expresie, obiectivul rămâne în forma standard cu spini, iar\n"
"instanța compilată rămâne un QUBO binar.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you display `maxcut_model` in a notebook, it shows the following formulation:\n"
msgstr "Dacă afișezi `maxcut_model` într-un notebook, acesta arată următoarea formulare:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{array}{rl}\n"
"\\text{Problem}\\colon &\\text{MaxCut}\\\\\n"
"\\displaystyle \\max &\\displaystyle \\sum _{\\left\\langle u,v\\right\\rangle \\in E}{\\frac{1-{\\left(1-2\\cdot b\\right)}_{u}\\cdot {\\left(1-2\\cdot b\\right)}_{v}}{2}}\\\\\n"
"&\\\\\n"
"\\text{where}&\\\\\n"
"&\\text{Decision Variables:}\\\\\n"
"&\\qquad \\begin{alignedat}{2}{b}_{i}&\\in \\left\\{0,1\\right\\}&\\qquad &\\text{a }1\\text{-dim array of }\\text{binary}\\text{ decision variables}\\\\\n"
"&\\forall i\\in \\left\\{0,\\ldots ,V-1\\right\\}&&\\\\\n"
"\\end{alignedat}\\\\\n"
"&\\\\\n"
"&\\text{Placeholders:}\\\\\n"
"&\\qquad \\begin{alignedat}{2}{E}_{i}&\\in V\\times V&\\qquad &\\text{a }1\\text{-dim array of placeholders with elements in }V\\times V\\\\\n"
"&\\forall i\\in \\left\\{0,\\ldots ,\\mathop{\\mathtt{len\\_{}at}}\\left(E,0\\right)-1\\right\\}&&\\\\\n"
"&&&\\\\\n"
"V&\\in \\mathbb{N}&\\qquad &\\text{a scalar placeholder in }\\mathbb{N}\\\\\n"
"\\end{alignedat}\\end{array}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{array}{rl}\n"
"\\text{Problem}\\colon &\\text{MaxCut}\\\\\n"
"\\displaystyle \\max &\\displaystyle \\sum _{\\left\\langle u,v\\right\\rangle \\in E}{\\frac{1-{\\left(1-2\\cdot b\\right)}_{u}\\cdot {\\left(1-2\\cdot b\\right)}_{v}}{2}}\\\\\n"
"&\\\\\n"
"\\text{where}&\\\\\n"
"&\\text{Decision Variables:}\\\\\n"
"&\\qquad \\begin{alignedat}{2}{b}_{i}&\\in \\left\\{0,1\\right\\}&\\qquad &\\text{a }1\\text{-dim array of }\\text{binary}\\text{ decision variables}\\\\\n"
"&\\forall i\\in \\left\\{0,\\ldots ,V-1\\right\\}&&\\\\\n"
"\\end{alignedat}\\\\\n"
"&\\\\\n"
"&\\text{Placeholders:}\\\\\n"
"&\\qquad \\begin{alignedat}{2}{E}_{i}&\\in V\\times V&\\qquad &\\text{a }1\\text{-dim array of placeholders with elements in }V\\times V\\\\\n"
"&\\forall i\\in \\left\\{0,\\ldots ,\\mathop{\\mathtt{len\\_{}at}}\\left(E,0\\right)-1\\right\\}&&\\\\\n"
"&&&\\\\\n"
"V&\\in \\mathbb{N}&\\qquad &\\text{a scalar placeholder in }\\mathbb{N}\\\\\n"
"\\end{alignedat}\\end{array}\n"
"$$\n"

