msgstr "Pașii următori {#next-steps}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  - Request a free trial of SQOA Solver by completing this [form](https://www.j-ij.com/en/qiskit-function-access).\n"
"  - Visit the [API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/jij-sqoa-solver) for this Qiskit Function.\n"
"  - Try an end-to-end example in the [maximum independent set problem](/tutorials/maximum-independent-set-jij-sqoa) tutorial.\n"
"  - Learn how to model optimization problems with [qiskit-addon-opt-mapper](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-opt-mapper/).\n"
"  - Learn how to model and exchange optimization problems with [JijModeling](https://jij-inc-jijmodeling-tutorials-en.readthedocs-hosted.com/en/latest/introduction.html) and [OMMX](https://ommx-en-book.readthedocs.io/en/latest/).\n"
"  - Read the SQOA-QR paper [\\[1\\]](#references) to learn more about the SQOA framework.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recomandări\">\n"
"  - Solicită o perioadă de probă gratuită pentru SQOA Solver completând acest [formular](https://www.j-ij.com/en/qiskit-function-access).\n"
"  - Vizitează [referința API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/jij-sqoa-solver) pentru acest Qiskit Function.\n"
"  - Încearcă un exemplu cap-coadă în tutorialul [problema mulțimii independente maxime](/tutorials/maximum-independent-set-jij-sqoa).\n"
"  - Află cum să modelezi probleme de optimizare cu [qiskit-addon-opt-mapper](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-opt-mapper/).\n"
"  - Află cum să modelezi și să schimbi probleme de optimizare cu [JijModeling](https://jij-inc-jijmodeling-tutorials-en.readthedocs-hosted.com/en/latest/introduction.html) și [OMMX](https://ommx-en-book.readthedocs.io/en/latest/).\n"
"  - Citește lucrarea SQOA-QR [\\[1\\]](#references) pentru a afla mai multe despre framework-ul SQOA.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

